    {
      "id": "clerk-penna",
      "name": "Penna Ledgerwell",
      "species": "Human",
      "gender": "Female",
      "age": 32,
      "occupation": "Town Clerk",
      "category": "government",
      "tags": [
        "clerk",
        "records",
        "precise"
      ],
      "description": "Penna holds down a records desk with callused competence and open ears.",
      "biography": "Walk into a records desk and you will find Penna Ledgerwell before you find a free chair. A 32-year-old Human town clerk, Penna greets trouble the way other folk greet weather: with a coat and a plan. She alphabetizes emergencies. The ribbon tags for 'urgent', 'political', and 'do not lose' travels with her almost everywhere. Essential to Mayor; threat to Orin; overflow to Hala. Her ambition is to digitize nothing and perfect everything on paper. Her nightmare is forged seals passing her desk. Right now, Flagged a warehouse writ with Pale Orin's distinctive pen pressure.",
      "personality": "Warm with regulars, curt with wasters; alphabetizes emergencies.",
      "motivation": "Secure enough ground to digitize nothing and perfect everything on paper.",
      "secret": "Quietly arranging matters around this problem: Flagged a warehouse writ with Pale Orin's distinctive pen pressure.",
      "rumor": "A smugglers' mark was seen near a records desk on a night Penna worked late.",
      "voice": "Polite public voice; sharper private asides when trust appears.",
      "appearance": "Looks like someone who sleeps lightly; distinctive detail is the ribbon tags for 'urgent', 'political', and 'do not lose'.",
      "portrait": "modules/townforge/assets/portraits/clerk-penna.webp",
      "token": "modules/townforge/assets/tokens/clerk-penna.webp",
